st,memory -Drat.skip=true -DskipITs -DfailIfNoTests=false -Dtest=TaskCoreTest#testGremlinJobWithSerializedResults` | `working-tree` | PASS (Java 11 Docker; 1 test, 0 failures, BUILD SUCCESS, exit 0) | `api-gremlin-001-serialized-java11-20260913.log` |\n| `docker run --rm -v /home/zy/code/hugegraph:/workspace -v /home/zy/.m2:/root/.m2 -w /workspace maven:3.9.0-eclipse-temurin-11 mvn test -pl hugegraph-server/hugegraph-test -am -P api-test,memory -Drat.skip=true -DskipITs -DfailIfNoTests=false -Dtest=VertexApiTest` | `working-tree` | FAIL (API server unavailable; connection refused) | `api-rest-001-vertex-java11-20260913.log` |\n| `timeout 180s bash tools/rust-rewrite-cluster/smoke.sh` | `working-tree` | FAIL (startup and initial REST writes passed, recovery phase timed out/connection reset; exit 124) | `api-rest-001-server-start-20260913.log` |\n M docs/evidence/rust-rewrite/api-gremlin-001-java11-docker-20260913.log\n M docs/evidence/rust-rewrite/api-gremlin-001-java11-docker-rerun-20260913.log\n?? docs/evidence/rust-rewrite/codex-loop.log.session-1\n?? docs/evidence/rust-rewrite/codex-loop.log.session-10\n?? docs/evidence/rust-rewrite/codex-loop.log.session-11\n?? docs/evidence/rust-rewrite/codex-loop.log.session-2\n?? docs/evidence/rust-rewrite/codex-loop.log.session-3\n?? docs/evidence/rust-rewrite/codex-loop.log.session-4\n?? docs/evidence/rust-rewrite/codex-loop.log.session-5\n?? docs/evidence/rust-rewrite/codex-loop.log.session-6\n?? docs/evidence/rust-rewrite/codex-loop.log.session-7\n?? docs/evidence/rust-rewrite/codex-loop.log.session-8\n?? docs/evidence/rust-rewrite/codex-loop.log.session-9\n?? nohup.out\n?? openjdk-17-jdk-headless_17.0.20+8-1~24.04_amd64.deb\n?? openjdk-17-jre-headless_17.0.20+8-1~24.04_amd64.deb\n776dabc39 docs(rust-rewrite): record rest server smoke result\n31724a540 docs(rust-rewrite): record session and environment context\n77b655d38 chore(rust-rewrite): persist agent orchestration\nPORT=8080\n{\"versions\":{\"version\":\"v1\",\"core\